================================================================================
REGRESSION TEST SUITE SPECIFICATION
================================================================================

PURPOSE: Quick validation that homepage still works after any change

TRIGGER: Every PR, every deployment

DURATION TARGET: <2 minutes total

SUITE COMPOSITION:

**Critical Path (Always Run)** — 30s
1. Homepage loads (smoke test)
2. No console errors
3. Hero visible

**Functional (Run on homepage changes)** — 60s
1. Featured carousel navigation
2. Product card click → product page
3. Hero CTA navigation

**RWD Smoke (Run on CSS/styling changes)** — 30s
1. Mobile portrait: No overflow
2. Desktop: Layout correct

**Command**:
```bash
npm run test:homepage:regression
```

IMPLEMENTATION:
```typescript
// tests/e2e/homepage/regression.spec.ts
import { test, expect } from '@playwright/test';

test.describe('Homepage Regression Suite', () => {
  test('critical path', async ({ page }) => {
    const errors: string[] = [];
    page.on('console', msg => {
      if (msg.type() === 'error') errors.push(msg.text());
    });
    
    await page.goto('/');
    await expect(page.locator('[data-testid="hero-section"]')).toBeVisible();
    expect(errors).toHaveLength(0);
  });
  
  test('featured carousel @homepage', async ({ page }) => {
    await page.goto('/');
    const carousel = page.locator('[data-testid="featured-carousel"]');
    await expect(carousel).toBeVisible();
    
    // Navigate carousel
    const nextBtn = carousel.locator('button[aria-label="Next slide"]');
    await nextBtn.click();
    
    // Verify slide changed
    const slide = carousel.locator('[data-active="true"]');
    await expect(slide).toBeVisible();
  });
});
```

